_trash/
*.local.md

# Machine-local marker, not part of the product. An empty file some Claude Code
# setups drop here to permit edits in a primary checkout. Never yours to commit.
.claude/.allow-primary-edits

# Marks this checkout as the engine, not somebody's workspace. Onboarding looks
# for it and refuses to touch remotes when it is there. Gitignored so it never
# reaches a user; see rule 11 in system/maintaining.md.
.os-nowa-engine
